{"id":469,"date":"2026-01-29T18:22:33","date_gmt":"2026-01-29T18:22:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/zigaclick.site\/?page_id=469"},"modified":"2026-01-29T18:22:33","modified_gmt":"2026-01-29T18:22:33","slug":"privacy-policy-2","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/zigaclick.site\/privacy-policy-2\/","title":{"rendered":"Privacy Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Welcome to our Balloon Toys website. Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect information when you visit our website.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">1. Information We Collect<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>We collect <strong>very limited information<\/strong> and only when necessary.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Personal Information (optional):<\/strong><br>If you contact us using our contact form, we may collect your name and email address only so we can respond to your message.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Non-Personal Information:<\/strong><br>We may collect basic, non-identifying information such as browser type, device type, and pages visited to help improve the website.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>We <strong>do not<\/strong> collect payment information, addresses, phone numbers, or any sensitive personal data.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">2. Children\u2019s Privacy<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Our website is designed to be <strong>family-friendly<\/strong> and safe for children.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>We do <strong>not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13<\/strong>.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>If you are a parent or guardian and believe your child has provided personal information, please contact us and we will remove it promptly.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">3. How We Use Information<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Any information we collect is used only to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Respond to questions or messages<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Improve website content and user experience<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Ensure the website functions properly<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>We <strong>do not sell, rent, or trade<\/strong> personal information.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">4. Cookies<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>We may use basic cookies or similar technologies to:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Understand how visitors use the site<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Improve performance and content<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p>You can disable cookies in your browser settings at any time.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">5. Third-Party Services<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>We may use trusted third-party tools (such as website analytics or hosting providers) that help operate the website. These services may collect non-personal usage data under their own privacy policies.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>We do <strong>not<\/strong> allow third parties to use this website for advertising or marketing to children.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">6. Data Security<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>We take reasonable steps to protect your information. However, no website can guarantee 100% security, so we encourage visitors to avoid sharing sensitive personal data.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">7. Links to Other Websites<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>Our website may include links to other sites for educational purposes. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of external websites.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">8. Changes to This Policy<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page with an updated date.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">9. Contact Us<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us through our website\u2019s contact form.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Welcome to our Balloon Toys website. Your privacy is important to us. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":fa